OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre campaigners launch
OL,4,Alegal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have launched a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge against plans for a new #65m
OL,8,Fswimming pool and leisure centre in
OL,9,FHove.
OL,11,FThe King Alfred Community Leisure Hub
OL,12,Fgroup claims Brighton & Hove City
OL,13,FCouncil (BHCC) failed to assess the
OL,14,Fexisting building's suitability for
OL,15,Freuse, as laid out in its own 2025
OL,16,Fsustainability brief for the
OL,17,Fregeneration project.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
