OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre campaigners launch
OL,4,Alegal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group says refurbishment of the
OL,7,Fpresent building, rather than its
OL,8,Freplacement, would offer "an
OL,9,Fextraordinary opportunity for a much
OL,10,Fmore ambitious sporting destination"
OL,11,Ffor the area.
OL,13,FA BHCC spokesperson said the authority
OL,14,F"cannot comment at this stage due to
OL,15,Fthe ongoing legal process".
